      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "逐组返回逻辑通道号；必须覆盖全部组并与 MODEL:INFO? 数量一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.topology_group_inputs", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "GROup:INPuts:GET? <group>", "query": "GROup:INPuts:GET? <group>", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.7.2"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "逐组返回物理输入端口号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.topology_group_outputs", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "GROup:OUTPuts:GET? <group>", "query": "GROup:OUTPuts:GET? <group>", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.7.3"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "逐组返回物理输出端口号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.input_measurement", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "INPut:LEVel:MEASure? <input>,<seconds>", "query": "INPut:LEVel:MEASure? <input>,<seconds>", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.4.6"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "同次查询返回平均输入电平与 crest factor；参数必须与冻结 selector 一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.input_level_limits", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "INP:LEV:AMP:LIM? <input>", "query": "INP:LEV:AMP:LIM? <input>", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.4.5"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "同次查询返回指定输入端口的平均电平允许窗口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.group_clipping", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "GROup:CLIpping:GET? <group>,<reset>", "query": "GROup:CLIpping:GET? <group>,<reset>", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.7.6"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "同次查询返回指定组的 digital clipping 千分比；reset operand 必须与冻结 selector 一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f64.system_status", "instrument": "f64", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "SYSTem:STATus?", "query": "SYSTem:STATus?", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "982222b7-4953-46cd-9949-00fa97882353", "document": "Propsim User Reference", "section": "20.4.2.5"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["PROPSIM F64", "F8800*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "返回系统干净状态或当前 warning/alarm 来源。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uxm.config_readback", "instrument": "uxm", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "CONFigure:NR5G:<cell>:<parameter> <value>", "query": "CONFigure:NR5G:<cell>:<parameter>?", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E2",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "236d9621-e3ce-4ed1-a8e1-7819b674dbcd", "document": "5G NR Test Application SCPI Reference", "section": "NR Cell Configuration / Application Mode NSA|SA"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["E7515B*"], "test_applications": ["5G_NR_Test", "5G NR Test"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "回读只到 E2，不代表 APPLY 后协议栈生效。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uxm.config_apply", "instrument": "uxm", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "BSE:CONFig:NR5G:APPLY", "query": null, "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "236d9621-e3ce-4ed1-a8e1-7819b674dbcd", "document": "5G NR Test Application SCPI Reference", "section": "General / Apply Configured Changes / Application Mode NSA|SA"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["E7515B*"], "test_applications": ["5G_NR_Test", "5G NR Test"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "Imm Action、无 query；只能靠随后协议栈状态支持 E3。LTE_NR_IRAT 范围未确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uxm.cell_status", "instrument": "uxm", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "BSE:STATus:NR5G:<cell>?", "query": "BSE:STATus:NR5G:<cell>?", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "236d9621-e3ce-4ed1-a8e1-7819b674dbcd", "document": "5G NR Test Application SCPI Reference", "section": "NR Cell / NR Connection Status"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["E7515B*"], "test_applications": ["5G_NR_Test", "5G NR Test"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "协议栈枚举 OFF|ON|CONNected|IDLE|AGGRegated|ACTivated；该状态查询可支撑 5G NR Test 的 APPLY 生效证据，LTE_NR_IRAT 范围未确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uxm.error_queue", "instrument": "uxm", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "SYSTem:ERRor[:NEXT]?", "query": "SYSTem:ERRor[:NEXT]?", "status": "unverified", "max_evidence_level": "E2",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "236d9621-e3ce-4ed1-a8e1-7819b674dbcd", "document": "5G NR Test Application SCPI Reference", "section": "System / Error Queue / Application Mode NSA|SA"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["E7515B*"], "test_applications": ["LTE_NR_IRAT"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "当前来源未证明 LTE_NR_IRAT 支持，禁止判绿或猜缩写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "uxm.dl_throughput", "instrument": "uxm", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "BSE:MEASure:NR5G:BTHRoughput:DL:THRoughput:OTA:<cell>?", "query": "BSE:MEASure:NR5G:BTHRoughput:DL:THRoughput:OTA:<cell>?", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E4",
      "source": {"kind": "notebooklm", "source_id": "236d9621-e3ce-4ed1-a8e1-7819b674dbcd", "document": "5G NR Test Application SCPI Reference", "section": "NR PHY Measurements / OTA DL Throughput / DL OTA all NR Results"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["E7515B*"], "test_applications": ["5G_NR_Test", "5G NR Test"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "6 doubles，平均值单位 bps；<cell> 可为具体 cell，ALL 表示所有 NR cells 结果之和；有效且大于零才是 E4。LTE_NR_IRAT 范围未确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "positioner.move_absolute", "instrument": "positioner", "mandatory": true,
      "command": "MOVEABS <axis> <position>", "query": null, "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E2",
