      "command": "PFBK(<axis>)", "query": "PFBK(<axis>)", "status": "confirmed", "max_evidence_level": "E3",
      "source": {"kind": "vendor-integration", "source_id": "aerotech-ensemble-ascii-v1.0", "document": "Aerotech_Ensemble_ASCII_TCP转台控制集成说明.docx", "section": "6-8,11-12"},
      "applicability": {"models": ["Aerotech Ensemble*", "A3200*", "Automation1*"], "firmware_versions": ["*"]}, "notes": "必须保存目标、原始反馈、经校准偏置修正值及误差阈值。"
